    "_comment": "Per difficulty: creature level_offset / hp / damage, weekly affix count, minimum party size and the level above the dungeon's level_min it asks for, death time penalty and party lives (-1 = none), reward scales (exp_budget = share of the player's own level threshold a full clear pays, gold, drop, bonus_count [min, max] efsun on the final chest item, tier_up chance), daily_rewards (-1 = unlimited), unlock_after (the difficulty a character must have cleared), keys the leader spends to open the gate, par_mult on the dungeon's par_s, seals (Zindan Muhru) per run. unlock_medal: the medal (bronze < silver < gold) the unlock_after clear must have earned. telegraph: multiplier on every telegraphed windup (shorter is harder); hazard_mult: on a dungeon hazard's period; boss_enrage_s: a boss still fighting after this many seconds enrages (0 = never).",
