  "rewards": {
    "_comment": "What a run pays. Experience is a budget: a full clear pays the difficulty's exp_budget share of the player's own level threshold, kill_share of it across the clear (each creature its forces' part) and completion_share at the end (x medal_exp); x party_exp for the party, x first_run_exp for the character's first rewarded run of the day, and never more than the level gap allows downward. The final chest (only for a member with a daily reward right left; the others went in as helpers) holds the dungeon chest table, one gear piece with bonus_count enchantments, Zindan Muhru (seals), the dungeon's key on key_drop difficulties, and the medal's extras; its galleons are galleons_per_level [min, max] x the run level x the difficulty's gold (+ medal_gold). The seal shop sells for seals at every dungeon gate.",
